{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-underlying-set-symbol","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0316","math_ordinal":76,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH27-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The surrounding martingale examples are defined on the probability space Omega, while X denotes a random variable rather than an underlying set whose negligible subsets could be measured.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt275.tex:86-90","source_normalized_sha256":"4b68ab3847feda7d6c62c1fbcbeebfa35eab7351ed5e78f4ddadea5df64b8015","source_text":"$\\mu$-negligible subsets of $X$ belong to $\\Sigma_0$","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt275.tex:80-83","target_normalized_sha256":"d6aef031749de4a79f450416826232dad5a75b90a0d538bd83fd60dc9a118ea2","target_text":"himpunan yang terabaikan terhadap $\\mu$ di dalam $\\Omega$ termasuk dalam $\\Sigma_0$","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S275"}
{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-underlying-set-symbol","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0317","math_ordinal":641,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH27-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The displayed complement immediately above is Omega minus E and the proof is verifying closure of a sigma-subalgebra of Sigma on Omega; X is not an underlying set here.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt275.tex:781-785","source_normalized_sha256":"ef4134d8ceb54caab08ad9ff82f7b935003f54909548161c181cda5c09a7de72","source_text":"$X\\setminus E\\in\\tilde\\Sigma_{\\tau}$","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt275.tex:771-775","target_normalized_sha256":"f13d8a789355be9e2c25a679b56d690cf02cb6df0cb95ae12824b5b0f737eac9","target_text":"$\\Omega\\setminus E\\in\\tilde\\Sigma_{\\tau}$","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S275"}
{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-underlying-set-symbol","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0318","math_ordinal":675,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH27-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The H_k and H'_k are level sets of stopping times on Omega and form partitions of conegligible subsets of that probability-space domain; no set X is bound.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt275.tex:841-844","source_normalized_sha256":"4b68ab3847feda7d6c62c1fbcbeebfa35eab7351ed5e78f4ddadea5df64b8015","source_text":"partitions of conegligible subsets of $X$","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt275.tex:831-834","target_normalized_sha256":"d6aef031749de4a79f450416826232dad5a75b90a0d538bd83fd60dc9a118ea2","target_text":"partisi dari himpunan bagian koterabaikan dari $\\Omega$","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S275"}
{"classification":"mathematical-misplaced-event-parenthesis","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0319","math_ordinal":767,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH27-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The maximal inequality bounds the probability of the event that the supremum is at least epsilon; the printed parenthesis closes Pr before the event comparison and leaves an unmatched final parenthesis.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt275.tex:969-971","source_normalized_sha256":"a2e6d8b1219b9ea2dc530fbd03cb92d34bb4baad5d88f0be7e458bbe5bc27210","source_text":"$\\Pr(\\sup_{n\\in\\Bbb N}|X_n|)\\ge\\epsilon)\\le\\bover1\\epsilon\\sup_{n\\in\\Bbb N}\\Expn(|X_n|)$","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt275.tex:961-964","target_normalized_sha256":"6cce0579c742069182e8402530594a7b0736b2b1a111c0df35869d91e717e0cc","target_text":"$\\Pr(\\sup_{n\\in\\Bbb N}|X_n|\\ge\\epsilon)\\le\\bover1\\epsilon\\sup_{n\\in\\Bbb N}\\Expn(|X_n|)$","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S275"}
{"classification":"mathematical-missing-math-delimiter-and-clause-punctuation","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0320","math_ordinal":802,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH27-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The printed atom absorbs X_n into the membership formula and lacks the punctuation separating the quantified index from the subject; a comma inside the preserved atom restores the intended clause without changing its variables.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt275.tex:999-1002","source_normalized_sha256":"a49f628a6dc359a8ae1b40a9759757732e865e42294b96fd4b1151a760820e16","source_text":"for each $n\\in\\Bbb N\\,\\,X_n$ is a conditional expectation","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt275.tex:992-996","target_normalized_sha256":"8316520d67ab148c8cd3653467ac33aa82eead05b14eec02d72932fa2ac8aa3d","target_text":"untuk setiap $n\\in\\Bbb N,\\ X_n$ adalah suatu ekspektasi bersyarat","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S275"}
{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-dyadic-index-bound","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0321","math_ordinal":834,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH27-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The dyadic endpoints on [0,1] are 2^{-n}r with integer indices up to 2^n. The printed r<=2^{-n} permits no positive integer index for n>0 and cannot generate the stated partition intervals I_n(t).","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt275.tex:1024-1027","source_normalized_sha256":"cf2caf7c505c179557be60e9aa9fc7599539fd240cb08a1c0ea4fd8612600eca","source_text":"intervals of the type $[0,2^{-n}r]$ for $r\\le 2^{-n}$","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt275.tex:1019-1022","target_normalized_sha256":"e9e1e4f4929d767cf4450c30ac498c17add81b233975354ac2b9870d5713531d","target_text":"interval jenis $[0,2^{-n}r]$ untuk $r\\le 2^n$","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S275"}
{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-filtration-surface","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0322","math_ordinal":861,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH27-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"A martingale is adapted to the non-decreasing filtration sequencen{Sigma_n} declared immediately before, not to the single varying symbol Sigma_n without its sequence binder; the stopping time two lines later uses the full filtration correctly.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt275.tex:1051-1054","source_normalized_sha256":"70ba39c72cd0a080504070c88dd659bba22a87363a88fb8623156e2c081e1e7b","source_text":"$\\sequencen{X_n}$ be a uniformly integrable martingale adapted to $\\Sigma_n$","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt275.tex:1048-1051","target_normalized_sha256":"40e05e7af715d5311cd1299f4ce2937a3aad1aff60f3b581ed1f743e14dfc7a6","target_text":"$\\sequencen{X_n}$ adalah martingal terintegralkan secara seragam yang teradaptasi terhadap $\\sequencen{\\Sigma_n}$","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S275"}
